{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n今日はどんな一日でしたか(o^^o)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は ほんと一日中\n暖かくて 過ごしやすかったな♪\n半袖になろうかと思った←早い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝に洗濯物回したんやけど\n今日は 乾燥機で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外出てから こんな天気なら\n洗濯物 外で干せばよかったぁーと\nかなり後悔（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどその分 風がほんと凄かった..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子とか飛んでったよーって方\nいたりする？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前歩きよったひとが\n帽子ぶわ～って飛ばされてきて\nそれをキャッチしました！！！\n( *｀ω´) どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。\nペラペラの洗濯物とかだったら\n絶対飛ばされるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果→外に干さなくて正解♪\n乾燥機でよかった＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみさ、あの お日様のにおいが\n小さい時から大好きで//\n安心する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乾燥機だしたあとの\n温かい感じも  好き←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ あと今日思ったこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分の桜は もう満開なんかな。\nどれくらい咲いてるんやろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさが上京した日 。\nちょうど 約、1年前かな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分空港までの道のり\n車の中から 満開の桜を見ていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年はこの桜はたぶん見れんよなー。\n東京の桜も、同じくらい綺麗かなー。\nって思いながら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜って 綺麗に咲いてすぐに散って\nすごく美しいのに、なんか悲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど すぐに散ってしまうからこそ\n咲いて居る間は\nめいいっぱい 最高に綺麗な姿で\nたくさんの人を笑顔にしてる。\nそこが魅力なんだねっきっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜って 深いなぁ(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満開の桜はもちろん綺麗やけど\n七部咲き？のチョコっと咲いてるのも\n可愛いから大好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーお花見したいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、そーだ！\nみさ with みさみさ推しで\nお花見パーティーしよう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき揚げ作ってくよ～\nうそちゃんとお弁当作るから！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして今年花粉症か！（;￣O￣）\nって疑惑があったんやけど\nどうやら違うようだし♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賛成のひと、はーい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな 桜のお話しで\n心がほっこりしたところで ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこりする写真あげる～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衛藤家の お姫様\nチワワのクッキーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、当時高校生のみさ。\n大分の実家で撮ってたやつが\nフォルダ見てたら出てきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの顔ほとんど見えてないけどね←\nメインはクッキーやけん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、\nなんでほっこりするかっていうと\nクッキーの口元注目！！！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ってる(=´∀｀)人(´∀｀=)ふにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ見たら めっちゃ癒される♪\nクッキーとみさの\nらぶらぶ写真でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今のみさの待ち受けだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも、していいよ( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライバル ←\nせいらりん家のミーコさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか共演できんかな～（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは このへんで♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3950456/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみさみさいごに、個人PVのダイジェスト映像見てね♪\n積極的な女の子、公園デートだよ！"}],"source":"archive"}